{"3880860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Croak Tales: Deep Dungeons", "steam_appid": 3880860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello adventurer! Are you looking for thrills searching for magical items in dungeons with your friends? Croak Tales is an online co-op extraction game within a soft-RPG in a medieval world, with proximity-based VoIP, imminent dangers, bosses, diverse biomes, progression, many classes to choose and character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/760308f31ca2f2da0b5f7f577c5800cb.avif?t=1780162288\" width=1225 height=429 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE CLASSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Croak Tales you can choose between different classes. It's not just cosmetic, each class has unique abilities that can impact the gameplay. In addition, you can also customize your character's appearance by changing skin patterns, color, and even clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/12d88f01deb664b545da0ea38df4995c.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/12d88f01deb664b545da0ea38df4995c.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/12d88f01deb664b545da0ea38df4995c.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a lone wolf or do you prefer teamwork? You can venture out alone, but in this game, teamwork will make the journey easier. You can choose from available classes, each with unique abilities that will facilitate your game progress. Want to defend your team? Choose the Tank and take damage for your friends. Want to clear the path for your pals? Choose the Rogue and disarm the traps along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/76c74243a35d1641e49486bb61231f41.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/76c74243a35d1641e49486bb61231f41.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/76c74243a35d1641e49486bb61231f41.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARE FOR THE WORST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and acquire valuable tools that will help you navigate the deep dungeons, such as a magic lantern with infinite charge, a mysterious globe that will show you the way, or even a special shell that will facilitate communication, but remember that you only have two hands, so choose wisely. In addition, evolve your characters by buying magic potions that will increase your health, stamina, resistance, etc…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/c4b671852535ba0350b6e6505b031ff7.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/c4b671852535ba0350b6e6505b031ff7.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/c4b671852535ba0350b6e6505b031ff7.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the wizard's quests by exploring the biomes and dungeons on your journey. It's your job to locate, transport, and extract valuable items from the deepest dungeons. Don't forget to retrieve the powerful magic stones, you don't want to face the bosses without them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/68df576ddbe5acf0b50d20ecfd2823c9.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/68df576ddbe5acf0b50d20ecfd2823c9.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/68df576ddbe5acf0b50d20ecfd2823c9.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of the traps and creatures scattered throughout the dungeons. It will be easy to enter, but they will try everything to prevent you from getting out. Learn to deal with the behavior of each creature and how to avoid each trap so you can get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/ca87bd2d9ef4dda7ba6b483399671813.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/ca87bd2d9ef4dda7ba6b483399671813.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/ca87bd2d9ef4dda7ba6b483399671813.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep an eye on the time, because in Croak Takes, time is your main currency, so be skillful in consuming as little as possible while exploring the dungeon, and wise enough to know when and on what to spend it. Collect magical items to acquire extra time and choose whether you will spend it to evolve your team, or give it up to have more time on your next exploration. The decision is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/3bc87249b093f6bf65a6a8f49d2d5875.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/3bc87249b093f6bf65a6a8f49d2d5875.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/3bc87249b093f6bf65a6a8f49d2d5875.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello adventurer! Are you looking for thrills searching for magical items in dungeons with your friends? Croak Tales is an online co-op extraction game within a soft-RPG in a medieval world, with proximity-based VoIP, imminent dangers, bosses, diverse biomes, progression, many classes to choose and character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/760308f