is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/3bc87249b093f6bf65a6a8f49d2d5875.poster.avif?t=1780162288\" width=700 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/3bc87249b093f6bf65a6a8f49d2d5875.webm?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/extras/3bc87249b093f6bf65a6a8f49d2d5875.mp4?t=1780162288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore, scavenge and survive ... or croak trying. Dive into murky, abandoned dungeons with your friends to recover an ancient object and reveal the history around this world. It's high-stakes extraction where teamwork is vital, survival is unlikely, and the chaos is half the fun.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/bde0313bd76c58fc831b974c1352e393122cb353/header.jpg?t=1780162288", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/1aa2ee40e96d8f2bdea18f3227146cc2d187d3fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780162288", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880860/1aa2ee40e96d8f2bdea18f3227146cc2d187d3fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780162288", "website": "https://squadonestudios.com/pt-br", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-9100F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><